      "action_statement": "Update python-3.12 to 3.12.13-r3 or later.",
      "status_notes": "CVE-2026-1502: http.client did not reject CR or LF characters in proxy tunnel headers or the tunnel host, allowing header injection into the CONNECT request. Upstream fixed it in https://github.com/python/cpython/issues/146211 (3.12 commit https://github.com/python/cpython/commit/c00c386faa579ad71196d33408644478488e43ec), first released in CPython 3.12.14; see https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-2026-1502. Checked Lib/http/client.py for the tunnel host and tunnel header validation that the fix adds in the python-3.12 package of every build published in the DHI Alpine 3.23 repository, 3.12.12-r0 to 3.12.16-r4, x86_64 and aarch64; both architectures agree. Builds before 3.12.13-r3 lack the fix; 3.12.13-r3 and every later build have it. The range ends at 3.12.13-r3."
    },
